---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="AviKaiDo is an AI products and consulting firm founded in Michigan by Alexander Khanukov — shipping production AI since the first chatbot wave."
  path="/about"
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="section__eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Builders first. Consultants who ship.</h1>
      <p class="answer">
        AviKaiDo is an AI products and implementation consultancy founded in Commerce Township,
        Michigan. We help businesses turn AI ambition into governed workflows and products that run
        on real data — continuing a practice that began with conversational AI in 2016 and now
        spans healthcare, finance, retail, and enterprise CX.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div>
        <h2>Alexander Khanukov</h2>
        <p class="section__eyebrow" style="margin-top: -0.35rem;">Founder &amp; CEO</p>
        <p>
          Alex leads teams building AI products that improve customer experience using machine
          learning — speech recognition, NLP, LLMs, and generative AI. He focuses on
          cross-functional collaboration, product vision, and delivering business value while
          championing the voice of the customer.
        </p>
        <p>
          Recent work includes enterprise AI architecture for oncology support at AstraZeneca,
          omnichannel chat and voice at CVS Health/Aetna, ML portfolio leadership at Sensormatic
          (Johnson Controls), and bank-scale conversational platforms as a VP of AI Product at
          Wells Fargo. He currently consults with healthcare organizations on AI and Epic
          EHR–adjacent systems, including work around Genesys contact-center stacks.
        </p>
        <p>
          Earlier roles span Royal Caribbean conversational UX, Technology Director at eMara.ai,
          and Applied UX leadership at MRM//McCann, plus engineering at OnStar/GM. He holds a B.A.
          in Telecommunications (Media) from Michigan State University, is Pragmatic Institute PMC
          Level I certified, and has been published in Chatbots Magazine.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Heritage</h2>
        <p>
          In 2016 AviKaiDo launched as a bot enablement company behind EveryBot CMS — an early
          conversation-management platform — and sponsored BotMakers Detroit to grow the local
          maker community. Those roots still matter: multi-platform conversational design,
          automation that reduces cognitive load, and tools that meet people where they already
          work.
        </p>
        <p>
          The company stayed alive through years of hands-on consulting and product leadership
          inside Fortune-scale organizations. Today AviKaiDo’s public focus is clear: AI products
          and AI implementation consulting for teams ready to move past pilots.
        </p>
        <ul class="industries" style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
          <li>Michigan roots</li>
          <li>Since 2016</li>
          <li>English &amp; Russian</li>
          <li>Chatbots Magazine</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
